                                                        task.getWorkflowTask().getName()))
                                        .orElseThrow(
                                                () -> {
                                                    String reason =
                                                            String.format(
                                                                    "Invalid task specified. Cannot find task by name %s in the task definitions",
                                                                    task.getWorkflowTask()
                                                                            .getName());
                                                    return new TerminateWorkflowException(reason);
                                                }));
}

